      "title_en": "Hotter than usual: 13-week longitudinal evidence that experienced heat follows local departures beyond absolute levels across 49 US states",
      "title_zh": "比往常更热：一项为期13周的纵向研究表明，在美国49个州，实际经历的高温与当地温度偏离绝对水平的情况密切相关",
